e=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Restores <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">5</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> and grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aid_(Condition)\" title=\"Aid (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Aid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Aid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Aid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Aid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aid_(Condition)\" title=\"Aid (Condition)\">Aid</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Aid\"> Condition: Aid </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aid_(Condition)\" title=\"Aid (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Aid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aid_(Condition)\" title=\"Aid (Condition)\">Aid</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Hit point maximum increased by <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">5</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.</li>\n<li>Hit point maximum increases by a further <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">5</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> for every <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slot_Levels\" title=\"Spells\">Spell Slot Level</a> above 2 used.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a skeleton at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;407&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;22</span>, down the stairs from Gut's bedchamber in the <a href=\"/wiki/Defiled_Temple\" title=\"Defiled Temple\">Defiled Temple</a></li>\n<li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lurgan\" title=\"Lurgan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lurgan.png/25px-Portrait_Lurgan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lurgan.png/38px-Portrait_Lurgan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lurgan.png/50px-Portrait_Lurgan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lurgan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lurgan.png/25px-Portrait_Lurgan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Portrait_Lurgan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lurgan\" title=\"Lurgan\">Lurgan</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Decrepit_Village\" title=\"Decrepit Village\">Decrepit Village</a></li>\n<li>In a stack of scrolls in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Since <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aid\" title=\"Aid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Aid_Icon.webp/20px-Aid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Aid_Icon.webp/30px-Aid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Aid_Icon.webp/40px-Aid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Aid_Icon.webp/20px-Aid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Aid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aid\" title=\"Aid\">Aid</a> is not a <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard</a> spell, this scroll cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Spell_Transcribing_Icon.webp/25px-Spell_Transcribing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Spell_Transcribing_Icon.webp/38px-Spell_Transcribing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/77/Spell_Transcribing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Transcribing Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Spell_Transcribing_Icon.webp/25px-Spell_Transcribing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Spell_Transcribing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribed</a> into a wizard's spellbook.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205152\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3212/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 44817/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10437/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1211546/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.380      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   74.380      1 -total\n 45.66%   33.963     13 Template:Icon_text\n 40.57%   30.176     36 Template:Trim\n 17.82%   13.256      6 Template:Icon_link\n 15.56%   11.572      3 Template:Uid\n 12.30%    9.148      1 Template:Condition\n 10.60%    7.885     13 Template:Ifempty\n  8.61%    6.407      1 Template:Main_only\n  8.29%    6.165      3 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8633-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205152 and revision id 378939. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}